  "steps": [
    "A held real directory response preserves focused incomplete numeric input. Three saved instances of one definition share their author name and display their distinct complete UUIDs. A missing body target stays visible and Check rejects it without touching source or draft.",
    "Explicitly selecting another same-name instance changes only the form. Rust still rejects assigning two bodies to one instance. Selecting the free character instance repairs the missing target; circle radius 12 and offset X 2 produce an exact source-preserving review.",
    "At 390px, Chinese, English and Japanese keep the instance input/select nodes, focus, selection, chosen UUID, reviewed source and approval. All actions and the name selector remain accessible. Confirmed Cancel preserves every author byte and the ordinary draft; reopening starts from the original missing target.",
    "A failing transport response revokes directory-dependent approval and preserves all edits. Manual Check remains available and explicitly reports unverified targets. Successful Refresh revokes manual approval until the complete form is checked against the new saved directory.",
    "Removing the selected instance in the real saved scene after review causes Apply to perform a new directory read and reject the stale approval. Physics source, ordinary draft and current form remain unchanged. The temporary scene is restored exactly before continuing."
  ],
